      "filename": "Bust of Léonce Verny IMG 0603.jpg",
      "title": "File:Bust of Léonce Verny IMG 0603.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9a/Bust_of_L%C3%A9once_Verny_IMG_0603.jpg",
